sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant H as Host / MCP client
  participant M as Model API
  participant S as Dice MCPServer
  Note over H,S: SDK 2.3.0 auto mode, stdio, protocol 2026-07-28
  H->>S: server/discover (version metadata)
  S-->>H: supportedVersions, capabilities, instructions
  H->>S: tools/list
  S-->>H: names, descriptions, input/output schemas
  U->>H: Roll 3d6, compare total with 12
  H->>M: Messages and model-format tool definitions
  M-->>H: Request roll(count=3, sides=6)
  H->>S: tools/call, id=3, arguments and metadata
  Note right of S: Validate, execute dice.roll
  S-->>H: id=3, content, structuredContent, isError=false
  H->>M: Model-format tool result
  M-->>H: Grounded explanation
  H-->>U: Each die, total, comparison
  Note over H,S: No initialize handshake on this captured modern path
